  - Tier 2: 1-5 days overdue (firm reminder, draft nudge)
  - Tier 3: 5+ days overdue OR surfaced 3+ times (explicit call to action)
  - Tier 4: Surfaced 5+ times with no action (flag for auto-suppress)

